# 🖱 MOUSE LOOK (Rotation)

### Always rotate

```csharp
float mouseX = Input.GetAxis("Mouse X");
float mouseY = Input.GetAxis("Mouse Y");
```

### Rotate only while RMB held

```csharp
if (Input.GetMouseButton(1))
{
    float mouseX = Input.GetAxisRaw("Mouse X");
    float mouseY = Input.GetAxisRaw("Mouse Y");
}
```

