# 🔍 MOUSE SCROLL (Zoom)

```csharp
float scroll = Input.GetAxis("Mouse ScrollWheel");
```

* `scroll > 0` → zoom in
* `scroll < 0` → zoom out
* `scroll == 0` → no scroll

