# ⭐ CURSOR CONTROL (VERY IMPORTANT)

## Show cursor

```csharp
Cursor.visible = true;
```

## Hide cursor

```csharp
Cursor.visible = false;
```

## Free cursor (default)

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.None;
```

## Locked cursor (FPS mode)

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;
Cursor.visible = false;
```

## Confined cursor (RTS/editor)

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Confined;
Cursor.visible = true;
```

