# 🎯 CAMERA MODES (READY TO USE)

## 1️⃣ FPS Mode (locked + hidden)

```csharp
Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;
Cursor.visible = false;
```

## 2️⃣ Editor Free-Look Mode (your mode)

Rotate with RMB, cursor visible + free:

```csharp
if (Input.GetMouseButton(1))
{
    Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.None;
    Cursor.visible = true;
}
```

## 3️⃣ Toggle cursor with ESC (common in games)

```csharp
if (Input.GetKeyDown(KeyCode.Escape))
{
    Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.None;
    Cursor.visible = true;
}
```

## 4️⃣ Click to lock again

```csharp
if (Input.GetMouseButtonDown(0))
{
    Cursor.lockState = CursorLockMode.Locked;
    Cursor.visible = false;
}
```

